      "zh-Hant": "出身與早期仕途",
      "en": "Lineage and early career"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "勒孔特是讓－雅克·德薩林的曾孫。他先前曾效力於西蒙·薩姆與諾爾·亞歷克西斯兩任總統。1902年他幾乎升上海地最高行政職位。",
      "en": "Leconte was a great-grandson of Jean-Jacques Dessalines. He had earlier served under two presidents, Simon Sam and Nord Alexis. In 1902 he had nearly risen to Haiti's top executive office."
     },
