    {
     "ord": 3,
     "period": {},
     "periodStartPrecision": null,
     "periodEndPrecision": null,
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "推翻安托萬·西蒙",
      "en": "Overthrowing Antoine Simon"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "在推翻西蒙的戰爭中，奧雷斯特·扎莫爾、達維馬·泰奧多爾與維爾布倫·紀堯姆協助勒孔特。奧雷斯特·扎莫爾與其兄弟查爾斯協助他招募農民軍。西蒙投降，登船流亡牙買加。1911年8月，勒孔特成為海地總統。",
      "en": "In the war to overthrow Simon, Oreste Zamor, Davilmar Théodore and Vilbrun Guillaume aided Leconte. Oreste Zamor and his brother Charles helped him recruit a peasant army. Simon capitulated and boarded a ship into exile in Jamaica. In August 1911 Leconte became president of Haiti."
     },
