     "periodStartPrecision": null,
     "periodEndPrecision": null,
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "任內施政與身亡",
      "en": "Presidency and death"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "他的任期從1911年8月14日至1912年8月8日。任內受到美國與德國銀行及商業利益競逐海地經濟的壓力。美國外交壓力促使他整頓國內秩序。他整編軍隊並著手發展公共教育體系。後來他在首都港口王子的總統府一場不明爆炸中喪生。",
      "en": "His presidency lasted from 14 August 1911 to 8 August 1912. It was subject to pressures from competing U.S. and German banking and commercial interests over Haiti's economy. U.S. diplomatic pressure encouraged him to impose order on the country. He reorganized the army and began developing a public education system. He was later killed in a mysterious explosion at the presidential palace in Port-au-Prince."
     },
