     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "恩帕盧本名卡爾·艾恩邦德（Karl Einbund），1888年生於科布拉圖村的帕盧農場，是佃農家六個孩子中最小的一個。家族農場位於韋斯內里鄉，距塔爾圖約12公里。1919年7月7日，他出任新任國家審計長。此後他長期擔任內政部長，並出任國會議長。",
      "en": "Eenpalu was born Karl Einbund in 1888 at the Palu farm in Kobratu village, the youngest of six children of a tenant farmer. The family farm lay in Vesneri parish, about 12 kilometres from Tartu. On 7 July 1919 he took up office as the new State Controller. He later served for a long period as interior minister and also became speaker of the Riigikogu."
     },
